---
/**
 * Station 07 — the receipt read.
 *
 * The document is drawn in the line's own language rather than faked as a bank
 * screenshot: redacted rules for the lines the system ignores, one live rule
 * for the amount it extracts. Values are demonstration data.
 */
---

<figure class="recibo">
  <div class="recibo-pair">
    <div class="recibo-doc" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="recibo-doc-head hatch"></span>
      <span class="recibo-doc-rule" style="--w:82%"></span>
      <span class="recibo-doc-rule" style="--w:64%"></span>
      <span class="recibo-doc-rule recibo-doc-rule--live" style="--w:71%"></span>
      <span class="recibo-doc-rule" style="--w:48%"></span>
      <span class="recibo-doc-rule" style="--w:57%"></span>
      <span class="recibo-doc-foot"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="recibo-out">
      <dl class="recibo-fields">
        <div>
          <dt class="plate">Monto leído</dt>
          <dd class="tabular recibo-amount">25.000,00</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="plate">Contacto</dt>
          <dd class="tabular">8831 · DV-7K2Q</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="plate">Límite del agente</dt>
          <dd class="tabular recibo-ok">dentro del tope</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="plate">Conversión</dt>
          <dd class="tabular recibo-ok">creada · Purchase enviado</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="note recibo-caption">
    El agente envía una frase disparadora y el sistema lee el comprobante: nadie
    tipea el monto. · Ejemplo · Datos de demostración
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .recibo {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .recibo-pair {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* The document: ticket stock with a punched foot. */
  .recibo-doc {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    align-content: start;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 15rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.1rem 0.8rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--stroke-thin) solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .recibo-doc-head {
    height: 1.4rem;
    width: 55%;
  }

  .recibo-doc-rule {
    height: 5px;
    width: var(--w);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-rule-strong);
  }

  .recibo-doc-rule--live {
    background-image: var(--brand-gradient);
    height: 9px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px -2px color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-leaf) 75%, transparent);
  }

  .recibo-doc-foot {
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    height: 10px;
    border-top: var(--stroke-thin) dashed var(--color-rule);
  }

  .recibo-fields {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .recibo-fields > div {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: var(--stroke-thin) solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .recibo-fields > div:first-child {
    border-top: var(--stroke-thin) solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .recibo-fields dt {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--color-bone-mute);
  }

  .recibo-fields dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-bone);
  }

  .recibo-amount {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.85rem) !important;
    color: var(--color-lime) !important;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .recibo-ok {
    color: var(--color-leaf) !important;
  }

  .recibo-caption {
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    .recibo-pair {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(11rem, 15rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
</style>
